Scoped Ensoniq PARIS Audio File (EPAF) demuxer

The probe, header field checks, codec mapping, channel and rate limits and the
fixed 2048-byte data offset in src/epaf.ts follow libavformat/epafdec.c
(epaf_probe, epaf_read_header); packet reads use the shared raw PCM reader,
following libavformat/pcm.c (ff_pcm_read_packet, ff_pcm_read_seek).
